  "latex": "\\int_a^b f(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\int_{\\alpha}^{\\beta}f\\big(\\varphi(t)\\big)\\varphi'(t)\\,\\mathrm{d}t,\\quad \\varphi(\\alpha)=a,\\ \\varphi(\\beta)=b",
  "summary": "定积分换元时必须同步更换积分上下限，换元后不必回代。",
  "conditions": "φ 在 [α,β] 上单调可导，且值域落在 [a,b] 内。",
  "notes": "最易错处是忘记换限。",
